    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHC263FAAC64B8AC3FA1A22C965EBB04CC" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Recorded pursuant to 18 CFR 154.402(a) and 18 CFR 382.202. FERC ACA is amortized monthly to expense account 928.</p>
      </div>
